The '''Welcome Back''' (おかえりミッション, ''Okaeri Missshon'', '''Welcome Back Missions''') is a campaign that appears when players return to the game after a certain amount of time has passed when the app hasn't been opened. The campaign includes exclusive [[Catnip Challenges]], stamps and stages going on during the return period. It was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]], it later received more content in Version [[Version 14.5 Update|14.5]].

