==Trivia==
*During the Welcome Back event, four unique notifications will appear:
**Can you feel it? The Cats miss you...
**Did you get your Comeback Stamp for the day? Get tons of bonus XP!
**Get 3 Cat Tickets each day from your Comeback Stamp reward!
**Did you get your Comeback Stamp for the day? Get 2 Rare Tickets with your 7th stamp!

